---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Backstage Pass — The V Spot Network" description="Your backstage pass to The V Spot: Nearly News, the podcasts, essays, live events, and a few excellent ways to get involved." type="WebPage">
  <main class="backstage">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="kicker"><span class="onair-dot"></span> The V Spot Network · Backstage Pass</p>
          <h1>You’re in.<br /><em>Mind the cables.</em></h1>
          <p class="intro">A little map of what I do, what I make, and where you can jump in. No lanyard required. The clipboard is mostly decorative.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#shows">Meet the shows</a>
            <a class="button button-quiet" href="#partners">Make something happen</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note">Hosted from Tralee, County Kerry. Broadcast wherever the Wi-Fi behaves.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-art">
          <img src="/backstage/dressing-room.webp" alt="A backstage dressing room at The V Spot" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high" />
          <figcaption>Backstage. Mind the cable. It’s probably important.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section" id="shows">
      <p class="grid-label">Now appearing on the network</p>
      <div class="show-grid">
        <a class="show-card" href="/shows/nearly-news/">
          <span class="number">01 · THE WEEKLY DESK</span>
          <h2>The V Spot: Nearly News</h2>
          <p>What’s happening in ecommerce, retail and tech, with the solemnity the stories absolutely do not deserve.</p>
          <span class="link-label">Watch the latest <b>↗</b></span>
        </a>
        <a class="show-card" href="/shows/ostrich-report/">
          <span class="number">02 · MARKETPLACE COUNTRY</span>
          <h2>The Ostrich Report</h2>
          <p>Marketplace people, real operating stories and the uncomfortable bits that don’t fit on a conference slide.</p>
          <span class="link-label">Meet the Ostrich <b>↗</b></span>
        </a>
        <a class="show-card" href="/shows/struggle-bus/">
          <span class="number">03 · CAREER HONESTY</span>
          <h2>The Struggle Bus</h2>
          <p>Good people talking honestly about work: the turns, the dents, the lessons and the occasional wrong exit.</p>
          <span class="link-label">Climb aboard <b>↗</b></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="read-strip">
      <div class="wrap read-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">The written word · fewer microphones</p>
          <h2>Read along on Substack</h2>
          <p>Essays, the Nearly News round-up and other thoughts that escaped before we could put them back in the edit.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="button button-paper" href="https://vinnyobrien.substack.com/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the Substack <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="consulting-section" id="consulting">
      <div class="wrap consulting-grid">
        <figure class="consulting-portrait">
          <img src="/brand/vinny-nrf.jpg" alt="Vinny O’Brien speaking at NRF in New York" width="733" height="1100" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Me at NRF in New York, looking like I definitely know where the next session is.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="consulting-copy">
          <p class="kicker">Behind the microphone · during office hours</p>
          <h2>Consultant, too.<br /><em>Still asking questions.</em></h2>
          <p>I’m Vinny. I work with SMEs, SMBs and enterprise teams. My consulting work has included GM, Calvin Klein Golf, PepsiCo and more — big-company complexity, small-team ingenuity, and the occasional spreadsheet with ideas of its own.</p>
          <p>The consulting keeps me close to the work. The shows let me ask how it actually went, then share the useful bits (and, occasionally, the bits that make a good story).</p>
          <p class="client-label">Selected consulting experience</p>
          <ul class="client-logos" aria-label="Selected consulting experience">
            <li class="client-mark"><img src="https://media.gm.com/content/dam/Shared/Images/Logos/gm/GM_Brandmark_Wordmark_Lockup_Blue_Horizontal_RGB.jpg" alt="General Motors" width="1890" height="400" loading="lazy" /></li>
            <li class="client-mark client-mark-ck" aria-label="Calvin Klein Golf">
              <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/Calvin_klein_logo.svg" alt="Calvin Klein" width="797" height="150" loading="lazy" />
              <span>GOLF</span>
            </li>
            <li class="client-mark"><img src="https://digitalassets.pepsico.com/transform/7c417867-1251-4602-8b69-1ea452a03bbe/Pepsico-logo-footer?q=75&w=3840" alt="PepsiCo" width="2000" height="608" loading="lazy" /></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="brand-note">Logos identify past client work; each belongs to its respective owner. No endorsement implied.</p>
          <a class="button button-quiet consult-cta" href="mailto:vinny@vinnyandco.com?subject=Consulting%20enquiry">Talk consulting <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section involvement">
      <div class="involve-copy">
        <p class="grid-label">Come on the show</p>
        <h2>Got a story?<br /><em>Bring the interesting bit.</em></h2>
        <p>We’re always looking for thoughtful guests for The Ostrich Report and The Struggle Bus. Nominate yourself, a colleague, or that friend who says “it’s a long story” and then delivers.</p>
        <p>No press releases, please. Murt burns them for warmth.</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/guest/">Pitch a guest (possibly you)</a>
      </div>
      <aside class="contact-card">
        <span class="number">THE GREEN ROOM DOOR</span>
        <h3>Something else?</h3>
        <p>Guest ideas, questions, useful disagreements, or a sponsor idea with actual legs.</p>
        <a href="mailto:vinny@vinnyandco.com?subject=Hello%20from%20The%20V%20Spot">Email Vinny <b>↗</b></a>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="partner-section" id="partners">
      <div class="wrap section">
        <p class="kicker"><span class="onair-dot"></span> Commercial break · the good kind</p>
        <h2 class="partner-heading">Good partners make<br /><em>good shows possible.</em></h2>
        <p class="partner-intro">If your brand wants to be part of work with a point of view, let’s talk. Sponsorships are built around the audience and the story, not a logo tossed into the confetti cannon.</p>
        <div class="partner-grid">
          <article class="partner-card featured">
            <span class="number">THE V SPOT NETWORK</span>
            <h3>Put your name in the credits.</h3>
            <p>Partner with the shows and help make independent ecommerce media a little louder, sharper and more fun.</p>
            <a href="mailto:vinny@vinnyandco.com?subject=The%20V%20Spot%20sponsorship">Talk V Spot sponsorship <b>↗</b></a>
          </article>
          <article class="partner-card">
            <span class="number">CAMP TRALEE</span>
            <h3>Take the conversation off-screen.</h3>
            <p>Camp Tralee brings the ecommerce crowd together in person. Have a look around; the kettle is probably on.</p>
            <div class="partner-links">
              <a href="https://camptralee.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Camp Tralee <b>↗</b></a>
              <a href="mailto:vinny@vinnyandco.com?subject=Camp%20Tralee%20partnership">Partner with Camp <b>↗</b></a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="partner-card">
            <span class="number">LONDON · 2027</span>
            <h3>Have I Got Ecomm News For You?</h3>
            <p>Ten live shows, two teams and a host, bringing ecommerce’s best stories to a room in central London. No cameras. No corporate theatre. Possibly a buzzer.</p>
            <a href="mailto:vinny@vinnyandco.com?subject=Have%20I%20Got%20Ecomm%20News%20For%20You%3F%20partnership">Ask about the 2027 series <b>↗</b></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap final-note">
      <p class="kicker">That’s the tour</p>
      <h2>Thanks for stopping by.</h2>
      <p>Follow a show, read a piece, pitch a guest, or get in touch. You’ve now seen more of the operation than most of the crew.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://www.youtube.com/@thevspotnews?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Subscribe on YouTube</a>
        <a class="button button-quiet" href="/">Back to the network</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
.backstage { overflow: hidden; }
.hero { background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 75% at 90% 20%, #272e59 0%, #1A1F3C 55%, #0A0A0A 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232,39,42,.4); }
.hero-grid { min-height: 520px; padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; gap: 46px; align-items: center; }
.kicker, .number { font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--tan); font-size: .72rem; }
.onair-dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 8px; background: var(--red); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(232,39,42,.85); vertical-align: 1px; }
.hero h1 { margin: 22px 0 18px; color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: .015em; text-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(232,39,42,.22); }
.hero h1 em, .involvement h2 em, .partner-heading em { color: #ff6b6d; font-style: normal; text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(232,39,42,.45); }
.intro { max-width: 520px; color: #d8d7d2; font-size: 1.14rem; }
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
.button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 13px 18px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .11em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s, background .2s; }
.button:hover, .button:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.button-primary { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }
.button-primary:hover, .button-primary:focus-visible { background: #ff3d40; }
.button-quiet { border-color: #555b7b; color: var(--paper); background: rgba(10,10,10,.22); }
.button-quiet:hover, .button-quiet:focus-visible { border-color: var(--tan); }
.hero-note { margin-top: 24px; color: var(--grey); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
.hero-art { position: relative; }
.hero-art img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.55); box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 rgba(10,10,10,.4); }
.hero-art figcaption { margin-top: 20px; color: var(--grey); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: right; }
.section { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 68px; }
.section .grid-label { margin-top: 0; }
.show-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.show-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 270px; padding: 24px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #2a3050; background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(10,10,10,.65), rgba(10,10,10,.15)); transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s; }
.show-card:hover, .show-card:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--red); }
.show-card h2 { margin: 16px 0 10px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--red); }
.show-card p { color: var(--grey); font-size: .94rem; }
.link-label { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; color: var(--tan); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.link-label b, .partner-card b, .contact-card b { color: var(--red); }
.read-strip { padding: 48px 0; background: #0A0A0A; border-top: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.25); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.25); }
.read-grid { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; }
.read-grid h2, .involvement h2, .partner-heading, .final-note h2 { margin: 8px 0 10px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.1rem); color: var(--paper); line-height: 1.05; }
.read-grid p:not(.kicker) { max-width: 620px; color: var(--grey); }
.button-paper { color: var(--black); background: var(--tan); white-space: nowrap; }
.button-paper:hover, .button-paper:focus-visible { background: #f0d8b0; }
.consulting-section { padding: 74px 0; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #171c38 0%, #101326 56%, #0A0A0A 100%); border-top: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.2); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232,39,42,.28); }
.consulting-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.28fr; gap: 52px; align-items: center; }
.consulting-portrait { margin: 0; }
.consulting-portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 360px; aspect-ratio: 2 / 3; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 22%; border: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.58); box-shadow: 14px 14px 0 rgba(10,10,10,.45); }
.consulting-portrait figcaption { max-width: 360px; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--grey); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .06em; }
.consulting-copy h2 { margin: 10px 0 18px; color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.7rem); line-height: 1.03; }
.consulting-copy h2 em { color: #ff6b6d; font-style: normal; }
.consulting-copy > p:not(.kicker):not(.client-label):not(.brand-note) { max-width: 700px; color: #c1c1c4; }
.client-label { margin: 28px 0 12px; color: var(--tan); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.client-logos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 10px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.client-mark { min-height: 76px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #f4f3ef; border: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.42); }
.client-mark img { display: block; max-width: 100%; max-height: 46px; width: auto; height: auto; object-fit: contain; }
.client-mark-ck { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.client-mark-ck img { width: 100%; max-width: 170px; max-height: 30px; }
.client-mark-ck span { color: #111; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .56rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .28em; line-height: 1; }
.brand-note { margin: 10px 0 0; color: #858594; font-size: .73rem; }
.consult-cta { margin-top: 20px; }
.involvement { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr .6fr; gap: 50px; align-items: center; }
.involvement h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.involvement p:not(.grid-label) { max-width: 660px; color: #c1c1c4; }
.contact-card { padding: 26px; border: 1px solid #3a4166; background: rgba(10,10,10,.35); }
.contact-card h3 { margin: 14px 0 8px; color: var(--tan); font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.5rem; }
.contact-card p { color: var(--grey); font-size: .92rem; }
.contact-card a, .partner-card a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px; color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration-color: rgba(210,180,140,.6); text-underline-offset: 5px; }
.partner-section { background: #0A0A0A; border-top: 1px solid rgba(232,39,42,.35); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(210,180,140,.2); }
.partner-heading { margin: 14px 0; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); }
.partner-intro { max-width: 650px; margin-bottom: 30px; color: var(--grey); }
.partner-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.partner-card { min-height: 260px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #2a3050; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #171c38, #101326); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.partner-card.featured { border-color: rgba(232,39,42,.7); box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 var(--red); }
.partner-card h3 { margin: 16px 0 10px; color: var(--tan); font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.1; }
.partner-card p { color: var(--grey); font-size: .92rem; }
.partner-card > a, .partner-links { margin-top: auto; }
.partner-links { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.partner-links a { margin-top: 18px; }
.final-note { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 78px; text-align: center; }
.final-note h2 { color: var(--tan); }
.final-note > p:not(.kicker) { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--grey); }
.final-note .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding-top: 52px; }
  .hero-art { max-width: 600px; }
  .show-grid, .partner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .show-card, .partner-card { min-height: auto; }
  .consulting-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
  .consulting-portrait img, .consulting-portrait figcaption { max-width: 360px; }
  .involvement { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  .read-grid { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 16vw, 4rem); }
  .hero-actions .button { width: 100%; }
  .section { padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 52px; }
  .partner-links { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
